{"task_id": "HumanEval/89", "solution": "```python\ndef encrypt(s):\n    \"\"\"Encrypts a string using a rotational cipher with a shift of 4.\"\"\"\n    LOWERCASE_ALPHABET = \"abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\"\n    UPPERCASE_ALPHABET = \"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ\"\n    SHIFT_AMOUNT = 4\n\n    encrypted_chars = []\n    for char in s:\n        if char.islower():\n            index = LOWERCASE_ALPHABET.index(char)\n            shifted_index = (index + SHIFT_AMOUNT) % len(LOWERCASE_ALPHABET)\n            encrypted_chars.append(LOWERCASE_ALPHABET[shifted_index])\n        elif char.isupper():\n            index = UPPERCASE_ALPHABET.index(char)\n            shifted_index = (index + SHIFT_AMOUNT) % len(UPPERCASE_ALPHABET)\n            encrypted_chars.append(UPPERCASE_ALPHABET[shifted_index])\n        else:\n            encrypted_chars.append(char)\n    return \"\".join(encrypted_chars)\n```\n"}
