{"task_id": "HumanEval/139", "solution": "def special_factorial(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the special factorial n! * (n-1)! * ... * 1!.\n    This function computes the product of factorials from 1! up to n!.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def calculate_factorial(k):\n        \"\"\"Calculates the standard factorial k!.\"\"\"\n        if k == 0:\n            return 1\n        fact = 1\n        for i in range(1, k + 1):\n            fact *= i\n        return fact\n\n    result = 1\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        result *= calculate_factorial(i)\n    return result"}
